---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Documentation"
  description="Setup and troubleshooting for OpenAthan’s first reference build, plus hardware adaptation and contributor documentation."
>
  <article class="docs wrap">
    <div class="docs-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">OPENATHAN</p><h1>Documentation</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Set up the first reference build, explore hardware adaptation, or get help with your device.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="docs-body">
      <aside class="notice">
        <strong>In development — first-time installation is not available yet.</strong>
        <p>
          USB recovery is available for compatible OpenAthan devices. Installation will open when
          tested firmware and approved recordings are published.
        </p>
      </aside>
      <div class="docs-cards">
        <a class="docs-card" href="/docs/getting-started/"
          ><strong>Getting started</strong><span
            >Connect USB and finish setup on the AtomS3R + Pyramid reference build.</span
          ></a
        >
        <a class="docs-card" href="/docs/troubleshooting/"
          ><strong>Troubleshooting</strong><span
            >Change Wi-Fi, reset your password, or resolve a connection problem on the reference
            build.</span
          ></a
        >
      </div>
      <p>
        For custom builds, see <a href="/docs/getting-started/#other-hardware">Other hardware</a>.
      </p>
      <h2 id="contributing">Contributing</h2>
      <p>
        Help improve OpenAthan with bug reports, documentation, or code. Read the contribution
        instructions for the part you want to work on:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/OpenAthan-Project/openathan/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md"
            >Firmware and device interface contributions</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/OpenAthan-Project/website/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md"
            >Website and browser installer contributions</a
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
      <h2 id="report-an-issue">Report an issue</h2>
      <p>
        Include what you expected, what happened, and the steps to reproduce it. Leave passwords and
        other private information out of your report.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/OpenAthan-Project/openathan/issues"
            >Device or firmware issues</a
          > — Athan playback, prayer settings, and the device’s local interface.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/OpenAthan-Project/website/issues"
            >Website or browser installer issues</a
          > — this website, documentation, and the USB wizard.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <h2 id="licenses">Licenses</h2>
      <p>
        OpenAthan software uses Apache License 2.0. Original project documentation uses CC BY 4.0.
        Third-party hardware, software, and recordings retain their own terms.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/OpenAthan-Project/openathan/blob/main/LICENSE"
            >Firmware software license</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/OpenAthan-Project/website/blob/main/LICENSE"
            >Website software license</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/OpenAthan-Project/openathan/blob/main/docs/LICENSE.md"
            >Firmware documentation license</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/OpenAthan-Project/website/blob/main/site/LICENSE.md"
            >Website documentation license</a
          >
        </li>
        <li><a href="/third-party-notices.txt">Third-party software notices</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
